                                <h1>Avyukta Neelkamal – Borivali West</h1>
  <h2>Premium Living Just Steps from Borivali Station, Avyukta Neelkamal</h2>

  <p><strong>Avyukta Neelkamal</strong> is a well-crafted residential project by <strong>Avyukta Neelkamal Group</strong>, ideally located in <strong>Borivali West</strong>, Mumbai. Offering a modern and sustainable lifestyle, the project is perfect for homebuyers looking for convenience, connectivity, and contemporary amenities. Situated just a short walk from the Borivali Railway Station and Metro Line, it brings the best of suburban comfort and urban accessibility together.</p>

  <h2>Project Highlights of Avyukta Neelkamal, Borivali West</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Project Name:</strong> Avyukta Neelkamal</li>
    <li><strong>Developer:</strong> Avyukta Neelkamal Group</li>
    <li><strong>Location:</strong> Shimpoli Road, Borivali West, Mumbai</li>
    <li><strong>Configurations:</strong> 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK Apartments</li>
    <li><strong>Carpet Area:</strong> 417 to 931 sq. ft.</li>
    <li><strong>Possession:</strong> December 2026 (as per RERA)</li>
    <li><strong>RERA ID:</strong> P51800035115</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Amenities of Avyukta Neelkamal, Borivali West</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>State-of-the-art Fitness Center</li>
    <li>Children’s Play Area</li>
    <li>Yoga & Meditation Zone</li>
    <li>Indoor Games Room</li>
    <li>Senior Citizen Sit-outs</li>
    <li>Multi-purpose Hall</li>
    <li>3-Level Podium Parking</li>
    <li>High-speed Elevators & 24x7 Security</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Why Buy at Avyukta Neelkamal? in Borivali West</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Prime Location:</strong> Just minutes from Borivali Station, SV Road, and the upcoming Metro Line 2A.</li>
    <li><strong>Modern Design:</strong> Thoughtfully planned homes with excellent ventilation and natural light.</li>
    <li><strong>Reputed Developer:</strong> Delivered projects with timely possession and quality construction.</li>
    <li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> Easy access to Western Express Highway, schools, hospitals, and shopping malls.</li>
    <li><strong>Investment Growth:</strong> High appreciation potential due to strategic location and ongoing infrastructure development.</li>
    <li><strong>Peaceful Living:</strong> Low-density project with limited apartments per floor for added privacy and comfort.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Location Advantages for Avyukta Neelkamal, Borivali West</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>500 meters from Borivali West Metro Station (Link Road)</li>
    <li>2 km from Borivali Railway Station</li>
    <li>Close to Sanjay Gandhi National Park, Don Bosco School, Apex Hospital, and major malls</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Contact Us for Avyukta Neelkamal, Borivali West</h2>
  <p>Looking to book your dream home at <strong>Avyukta Neelkamal</strong>? Contact us for the latest prices, floor plans, site visit bookings, and exclusive launch offers.</p>

                                
